@startuml UC-05-Memberi-Rating
title Sequence Diagram: Memberi Rating

actor "Users (Learner)" as User
participant "Halaman Detail Materi\ndengan Komponen Rating\n(React)" as UI
participant "POST /api/rating" as API
participant "RatingController" as Controller
participant "RatingService" as Service
database "PostgreSQL\n(tabel Rating,\ntabel Materi)" as DB

User -> UI: Berada di halaman detail materi
activate UI
UI --> User: Menampilkan komponen\nrating bintang (1-5)
User -> UI: Mengklik bintang\n(misal: 4 bintang)
UI -> UI: Update UI bintang\n(visual feedback)
UI -> API: POST /api/rating\n{ idMateri, idPengguna, nilaiRating: 4 }
activate API
API -> Controller: submitRating()
activate Controller
Controller -> Service: createOrUpdateRating(data)
activate Service

alt Rating valid (1-5)
    Service -> DB: SELECT * FROM Rating\nWHERE idMateri = '[id]'\nAND idPengguna = '[userId]'
    activate DB
    DB --> Service: Return hasil pengecekan
    deactivate DB
    
    alt Pengguna belum pernah rating
        Service -> DB: INSERT INTO Rating\n(idMateri, idPengguna,\nnilaiRating, tanggal)\nVALUES ('[id]', '[userId]', 4, NOW())
        activate DB
        DB --> Service: INSERT success
        deactivate DB
        Service -> DB: SELECT AVG(nilaiRating)\nFROM Rating\nWHERE idMateri = '[id]'
        activate DB
        DB --> Service: Return ratingRataRata baru
        deactivate DB
        Service -> DB: UPDATE Materi SET\nratingRataRata = '[avg]'\nWHERE idMateri = '[id]'
        activate DB
        DB --> Service: UPDATE success
        deactivate DB
        Service --> Controller: { success: true,\nmessage: "Rating berhasil",\nnewAverage: '[avg]' }
        Controller --> API: Response 201 Created
        API --> UI: Response sukses
        UI --> User: Tampilkan notifikasi\n"Rating berhasil diberikan"
        UI --> User: Update UI dengan\nrating terbaru
    else Pengguna sudah pernah rating
        Service --> Controller: { success: false,\nmessage: "Sudah rating",\ncurrentRating: X, confirm: true }
        Controller --> API: Response 200 OK
        API --> UI: Response konfirmasi
        UI --> User: Tampilkan dialog\n"Anda sudah rating X bintang.\nUbah rating?"
        
        alt User pilih "Ya, Ubah"
            User -> UI: Klik "Ya"
            UI -> API: POST /api/rating/update\n{ forceUpdate: true, nilaiRating: 4 }
            activate API
            API -> Controller: updateRating()
            Controller -> Service: updateExistingRating()
            Service -> DB: UPDATE Rating SET\nnilaiRating = 4, tanggal = NOW()\nWHERE idMateri = '[id]'\nAND idPengguna = '[userId]'
            activate DB
            DB --> Service: UPDATE success
            deactivate DB
            note right: Lanjut kalkulasi rata-rata
            Service -> DB: Kalkulasi ulang\nratingRataRata
            DB --> Service: Return avg baru
            Service --> Controller: { success: true }
            Controller --> API: Response 200 OK
            API --> UI: Response sukses
            deactivate API
            UI --> User: Update UI
        else User pilih "Batal"
            User -> UI: Klik "Batal"
            UI --> User: Tutup dialog,\ntidak ada perubahan
        end
    end
    
else Rating tidak valid (bukan 1-5)
    Service --> Controller: { success: false,\nerror: "Rating harus 1-5" }
    Controller --> API: Response 400 Bad Request
    API --> UI: Error response
    UI --> User: Tampilkan error
end

deactivate Service
deactivate Controller
deactivate API
deactivate UI

== Exception: Error Kalkulasi Rata-Rata ==

note over DB
  Jika UPDATE rata-rata gagal,
  rating individual tetap tersimpan.
  Background job akan kalkulasi
  ulang nanti.
end note

@enduml
